/div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5f/Screenshot_2025-12-09-18-01-36-88_507ff6669c2c4ef3cc2fd79388a54e6e.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251209110222\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Image of Blizzard&#39;s Bane \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5f/Screenshot_2025-12-09-18-01-36-88_507ff6669c2c4ef3cc2fd79388a54e6e.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209110222\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"205\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Screenshot 2025-12-09-18-01-36-88 507ff6669c2c4ef3cc2fd79388a54e6e.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Screenshot_2025-12-09-18-01-36-88_507ff6669c2c4ef3cc2fd79388a54e6e.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Screenshot_2025-12-09-18-01-36-88_507ff6669c2c4ef3cc2fd79388a54e6e.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Image of Blizzard's Bane </p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Blizzard's Bane</b> is a powerful pickaxe that can be obtained through warming all of the pig statues in the <a href=\"/wiki/Icelands\" title=\"Icelands\">Icelands</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Snowy_Peaks\" title=\"Snowy Peaks\">Snowy Peaks</a>. When it hits an ore, all of the unbroken pieces have the regular cracked texture + a layer of ice around them. (This ice does not appear to change how difficult the ore is to break.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p>First, obtain the following items:\n</p>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Blossom\" title=\"Burning Blossom\">Burning Blossom</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Meteor_Core\" title=\"Meteor Core\">Meteor core</a> x 8</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lab_Card\" title=\"Lab Card\">Lab Card</a> Does not consume</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">Flamethrower</a> Does not consume</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a> Does not consume(For mobile use)</li></ol>\n<p>Things to keep in mind before doing this:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Disconnecting will reset your progress and lose any items placed in the statues; make sure you have enough time to do everything.</li>\n<li>The statues don't have to be activated in any particular order, the numbered order is the most convenient when starting from spawn.</li></ul><p>\nGo to the first <b>six locations</b> on the map and use the <a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">Flamethrower</a> to melt the ice for each pig statue.  <i>Don't leave them before activating them with the blossoms or cores!</i> Placing a <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Blossom\" title=\"Burning Blossom\">Burning Blossom</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor_Core\" title=\"Meteor Core\">Meteor Core</a> into each one and the <b>seventh in the Observatory</b> and <b>eighth in the ice cave</b>, you should see an orange glow in each statue. (Drag the object into them)</p><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 453px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/61/SecondFloorInObservatory.png/revision/latest?cb=20251208132903\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Map of frozen statues in the second floor of \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/61/SecondFloorInObservatory.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/453?cb=20251208132903\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"453\" height=\"216\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"SecondFloorInObservatory.png\" data-image-key=\"SecondFloorInObservatory.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:SecondFloorInObservatory.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Map of frozen statues in the second floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Gizmo%27s_Observatory\" title=\"Gizmo&#39;s Observatory\">Gizmo's Observatory</a></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/67/Altar4.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209120344\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Frozen statue\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/67/Altar4.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209120344\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"170\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Altar4.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar4.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Altar4.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Frozen statue</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span id=\"Frozen_Statue_Locations_.281-6.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Frozen_Statue_Locations_(1-6)\">Frozen Statue Locations (1-6)</span></h2>\n<p>Remember to melt + place a <b>Burning Blossom</b> or <b>Meteor Core</b> in each statue.\n</p>\n<ol><li><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 190px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cd/Altar1.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209115450\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"This one is underneath the waterfall\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"190\" height=\"167\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Altar1.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cd/Altar1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/190?cb=20251209115450\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cd/Altar1.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209115450\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"This one is underneath the waterfall\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cd/Altar1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/190?cb=20251209115450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"190\" height=\"167\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Altar1.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cd/Altar1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/190?cb=20251209115450\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Altar1.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><i>This one is underneath the waterfall</i></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 190px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cc/Altar2.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209120524\" class=\"mw-file-descr