gure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 151px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8f/Altar5.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121107\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Altar5\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"151\" height=\"104\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Altar5.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar5.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8f/Altar5.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121107\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8f/Altar5.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121107\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Altar5\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8f/Altar5.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121107\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"151\" height=\"104\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Altar5.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar5.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8f/Altar5.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121107\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Altar5.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 190px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/78/Altar6.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121141\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"This is located higher up on the way to the Observatory.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"190\" height=\"148\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Altar6.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar6.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/78/Altar6.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/190?cb=20251209121141\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/78/Altar6.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121141\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"This is located higher up on the way to the Observatory.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/78/Altar6.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/190?cb=20251209121141\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"190\" height=\"148\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Altar6.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar6.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/78/Altar6.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/190?cb=20251209121141\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Altar6.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><i>This is located higher up on the way to the Observatory.</i></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li></ol>\n<h2><span id=\"Observatory_Statue_.287.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Observatory_Statue_(7)\">Observatory Statue (7)</span></h2><p>\nPlace a <b>Burning Blossom</b> or <b>Meteor Core</b> into the statue in Gizmo's Observatory.</p><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 133px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f3/Altar7.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121405\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"133\" height=\"68\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Altar7.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar7.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f3/Altar7.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121405\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f3/Altar7.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121405\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f3/Altar7.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121405\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"133\" height=\"68\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Altar7.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar7.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f3/Altar7.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121405\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Altar7.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gizmo%27s_Observatory\" title=\"Gizmo&#39;s Observatory\">Gizmo's Observatory</a></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>Use the <b>Lab Card</b> to open the door to the second floor.</p><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3b/Use_lab_card.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121559\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Use lab card\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"142\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Use lab card.png\" data-image-key=\"Use_lab_card.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3b/Use_lab_card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209121559\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3b/Use_lab_card.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121559\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Use lab card\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3b/Use_lab_card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209121559\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"142\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Use lab card.png\" data-image-key=\"Use_lab_card.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3b/Use_lab_card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209121559\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Use_lab_card.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fa/Altar7Look.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121640\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Altar7Look\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"125\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Altar7Look.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar7Look.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fa/Altar7Look.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209121640\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fa/Altar7Look.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121640\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Altar7Look\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fa/Altar7Look.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209121640\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"125\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Altar7Look.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar7Look.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fa/Altar7Look.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209121640\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Altar7Look.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span id=\"Cave_Statue_.288.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cave_Statue_(8)\">Cave Statue (8)</span></h2>\n<p>Go to the final location, using the <b>Flamethrower</b> if needed to enter the caves. Walk down until the floor is <b>solid ice</b>, and there should be a drop to an area of <b>transparent ice</b>. (It'll be next to a stone path to the <b>Void</b>). Melt the ice above the huge ice block to open the entrance, and place <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Blossom\" title=\"Burning Blossom\">Burning Blossom</a> into the last statue.\n</p>\n<ol><li>Closest entry to the cave system.<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 167px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Closest_entry.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122406\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Closest entry\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"167\" height=\"136\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Closest entry.png\" data-image-key=\"Closest_entry.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Closest_entry.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122406\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Closest_entry.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122406\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Closest entry\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Closest_entry.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122406\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"167\" height=\"136\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Closest entry.png\" data-image-key=\"Closest_entry.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Closest_entry.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122406\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Closest_entry.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>Go until you see the icy area with the dark rocks on the ceiling. Burn the ice above connected to the dark rocks. (Run up the sloped rocks with the <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a> until you can use the <a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">Flamethrower</a> for the ice, then jump down once the rock falls.)<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/ff/GoAltar8.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122520\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"GoAltar8\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"118\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"GoAltar8.png\" data-image-key=\"GoAltar8.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/ff/GoAltar8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209122520\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/ff/GoAltar8.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122520\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"GoAltar8\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/ff/GoAltar8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209122520\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"118\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"GoAltar8.png\" data-image-key=\"GoAltar8.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/ff/GoAltar8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209122520\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:GoAltar8.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>There should be 7 fires already active. Place a <b>Burning Blossom</b> or <b>Meteor Core</b> in the final statue before the ice, and grab the <b>Blizzard's Bane</b> from the pedestal after the ice melts.<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 300px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/InAltar8.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209123135\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"After activating 7, standing on the final statue needed to melt the ice.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"InAltar8.png\" data-image-key=\"InAltar8.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/InAltar8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20251209123135\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/InAltar8.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209123135\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"After activating 7, standing on the final statue needed to melt the ice.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/InAltar8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20251209123135\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"InAltar8.png\" data-image-key=\"InAltar8.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/InAltar8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20251209123135\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:InAltar8.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">After activating 7, standing on the final statue needed to melt the ice.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 390px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/AltarWorking.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209123313\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"After activating all 8, the Blizzard&#39;s Bane spawns and can be stored.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"390\" height=\"288\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"AltarWorking.png\" data-image-key=\"AltarWorking.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/AltarWorking.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/390?cb=20251209123313\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/AltarWorking.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209123313\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"After activating all 8, the Blizzard&#039;s Bane spawns and can be stored.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/AltarWorking.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/390?cb=20251209123313\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"390\" height=\"288\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"AltarWorking.png\" data-image-key=\"AltarWorking.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/AltarWorking.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/390?cb=20251209123313\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:AltarWorking.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">After activating all 8, the Blizzard's Bane spawns and can be stored.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li></ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831184636\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 106/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 56/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019457/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.803      1 Template:Pickaxe\n100.00%   27.803      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4751-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831184636 and revision id 20824. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Burning Blossom","exists":true},{"title":"Flamethrower","exists":true},{"title":"Fusion Coil","exists":true},{"title":"Gizmo's Observatory","exists":true},{"title":"Icelands","exists":true},{"title":"Lab Card","exists":true},{"title":"Meteor Core","exists":true},{"title":"Snowy Peaks","exists":true}],"images":["IMG_bb.png","Screenshot_2025-12-09-18-01-36-88_507ff6669c2c4ef3cc2fd79388a54e6e.jpg","SecondFloorInObservatory.png","Altar4.png","Altar1.png","Altar2.png","GoAltar2.png","Altar3.png","Altar4Map.png","Altar5.png","Altar6.png","Altar7.png","Use_lab_card.png","Altar7Look.png","Closest_entry.png","GoAltar8.png","InAltar8.png","AltarWorking.png"]}
